                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game looked like a fun 2d sidescroller like Shovel Knight or Ducktales...Oh great, another blah mobile port on Steam. These are just too easy to spot now. \nEach level gives you a rating 1 to 3 stars...Option to continue where you left off-for 500 diamonds!!!...Interface consists of icons without any words to describe what is what...Look Im 36 fucking years old for Christ's sake, how hard is it to put \"options\", \"controls\" etc etc etc. \n1st stage has about a million interruptions to teach you the game. It's not difficult but thanks for treating me like an idiot. \nOne hit and youre dead. \nEach stage is timed so you better hurry.\nShots are limited. \nGraphics are kinda nice though. \n",
